WEBVTT

NOTE LUMO, The Gospel of Luke 1:1-56 (Arclight 6_GOLuke2601), en.
NOTE Timings: whisper.cpp small -dtw small per speech burst on the isolated dialogue (dialoguenhance centre channel), first word on the burst start, 2026-11-27.

1
00:01:25.550 --> 00:01:28.050
In the time of Herod king of Judea

2
00:01:28.750 --> 00:01:31.200
there was a priest named Zechariah,

3
00:01:31.750 --> 00:01:34.300
who belonged to the priestly division of Abijah;

4
00:01:36.600 --> 00:01:40.000
his wife Elizabeth was also a descendant of Aaron.

5
00:01:40.900 --> 00:01:43.200
Both of them were righteous in the sight of God,

6
00:01:43.750 --> 00:01:47.950
observing all the Lord's commands and decrees blamelessly.

7
00:01:48.600 --> 00:01:50.000
But they were childless

8
00:01:50.350 --> 00:01:52.700
because Elizabeth was not able to conceive,

9
00:01:53.450 --> 00:01:55.350
and they were both very old.

10
00:01:58.150 --> 00:02:01.050
Once when Zechariah's division was on duty

11
00:02:01.600 --> 00:02:04.320
and he was serving as priest before God,

12
00:02:04.420 --> 00:02:08.600
he was chosen by lot, according to the custom of the priesthood,

13
00:02:08.900 --> 00:02:12.000
to go into the temple of the Lord and burn incense.

14
00:02:12.900 --> 00:02:15.400
And when the time for the burning of incense came,

15
00:02:15.800 --> 00:02:19.150
all the assembled worshipers were praying outside.

16
00:02:29.550 --> 00:02:33.500
Then an angel of the Lord appeared to him,

17
00:02:33.600 --> 00:02:36.750
standing at the right side of the altar of incense.

18
00:02:37.750 --> 00:02:40.050
When Zechariah saw him, he was startled

19
00:02:40.150 --> 00:02:42.500
and was gripped with fear.

20
00:02:42.800 --> 00:02:46.950
But the angel said to him: Do not be afraid, Zechariah;

21
00:02:47.700 --> 00:02:49.500
your prayer has been heard.

22
00:02:49.600 --> 00:02:53.100
Your wife Elizabeth will bear you a son,

23
00:02:53.450 --> 00:02:55.050
and you are to call him John.

24
00:02:55.950 --> 00:02:58.050
He will be a joy and delight to you,

25
00:02:58.400 --> 00:03:00.750
and many will rejoice because of his birth,

26
00:03:01.600 --> 00:03:03.650
for he will be great in the sight of the Lord.

27
00:03:04.070 --> 00:03:07.650
He is never to take wine or other fermented drink,

28
00:03:08.100 --> 00:03:11.900
and he will be filled with the Holy Spirit even before he is born.

29
00:03:13.650 --> 00:03:16.090
He will bring back many of the people of Israel

30
00:03:16.190 --> 00:03:17.550
to the Lord their God.

31
00:03:18.650 --> 00:03:20.500
And he will go on before the Lord,

32
00:03:20.850 --> 00:03:23.350
in the spirit and power of Elijah,

33
00:03:23.450 --> 00:03:26.100
to turn the hearts of the parents to their children

34
00:03:26.800 --> 00:03:29.600
and the disobedient to the wisdom of the righteous,

35
00:03:30.250 --> 00:03:32.750
to make ready a people prepared for the Lord.

36
00:03:36.050 --> 00:03:40.400
Zechariah asked the angel: How can I be sure of this?

37
00:03:41.650 --> 00:03:45.300
I am an old man and my wife is well along in years.

38
00:03:47.250 --> 00:03:49.900
The angel said to him: I am Gabriel.

39
00:03:50.550 --> 00:03:52.300
I stand in the presence of God,

40
00:03:53.050 --> 00:03:54.490
and I have been sent to speak to you

41
00:03:54.590 --> 00:03:58.450
and to tell you this good news.

42
00:03:58.550 --> 00:04:01.090
And now you will be silent and not able to speak

43
00:04:01.190 --> 00:04:02.950
until the day this happens,

44
00:04:03.050 --> 00:04:05.580
because you did not believe my words,

45
00:04:05.680 --> 00:04:09.750
which will come true at their appointed time.

46
00:04:16.450 --> 00:04:19.450
Meanwhile, the people were waiting for Zechariah

47
00:04:19.950 --> 00:04:25.650
and wondering why he stayed so long in the temple.

48
00:04:25.750 --> 00:04:31.030
When he came out, he could not speak to them.

49
00:04:31.130 --> 00:04:34.150
They realized he had seen a vision in the temple,

50
00:04:34.250 --> 00:04:39.350
for he kept making signs to them but remained unable to speak.

51
00:04:41.300 --> 00:04:44.600
When his time of service was completed, he returned home.

52
00:04:46.150 --> 00:04:48.700
After this his wife Elizabeth became pregnant

53
00:04:49.350 --> 00:04:51.600
and for five months remained in seclusion.

54
00:04:53.100 --> 00:04:55.450
The Lord has done this for me, she said.

55
00:04:56.250 --> 00:04:58.050
In these days he has shown his favor

56
00:04:58.150 --> 00:05:00.700
and taken away my disgrace among the people.
